SDUSD::lockedRewardsRemaining
├── when no reward period has been started
│   └── it should return zero
├── when a reward period is active
│   ├── at periodStart
│   │   └── it should return rewardsForPeriod
│   ├── between periodStart and rewardPeriodFinish
│   │   ├── it should calculate the remaining linear fraction
│   │   └── it should round the locked amount up
│   ├── when the remaining fraction divides exactly
│   │   └── it should not add an extra wei while rounding up
│   └── immediately before rewardPeriodFinish
│       └── it should return the final still-locked fraction
├── when block timestamp equals rewardPeriodFinish
│   └── it should return zero
└── when block timestamp is after rewardPeriodFinish
    └── it should return zero
